,"P","2D","P","3S","P","3N","P","4S","P","P","P"],"names":["South","West","North","East","South","West","North","East"]},"ops":[["hc","hq"],["nt","West leads the @HQ against 4@S.\n\n"],["pg",""],["lc","hq"],["pc","hq"],["md","0,ha,,d5"],["hs","wh"],["at","West would not lead the @HQ if he held the @HA as well, "],["pg",""],["ls","wh"],["md","0,d5,,ha"],["hs","nheh"],["at","so it would be a mistake for South to cover with dummy's @HK at trick 1. East would win the @HA "],["pg",""],["ls","nheh"],["pc","hkhah"],["pg",""],["hs","ehwh"],["at","and the defense would win the next 2 tricks in hearts. "],["pg",""],["ls","ehwh"],["pc","h7hhh"],["pg",""],["pc","hjhhh"],["pg",""],["hs","ssesws"],["at","South would then have to lose at least 1 trump trick and the contract would fail. "],["pg",""],["ls","sswses"],["up","11"],["hs","nh"],["nt","South should play a low heart from both hands at trick 1. "],["pg",""],["ls","nh"],["pc","hhh"],["pg",""],["hs","whshnh"],["at","South's @H10 makes it unsafe for West to continue hearts, "],["pg",""],["ls","whnhsh"],["hs","wcsc"],["at","so West will switch to a club which South wins with the @CA. "],["pg",""],["ls","wcsc"],["pc","cccc"],["pg",""],["hs","ndsh"],["at","Dummy's diamond suit will eventually provide a parking place for at least 1 of South's heart losers, "],["pg",""],["ls","ndsh"],["hs","sswses"],["at","so South must focus his attention on playing the trump suit for only 1 loser. Both defenders follow small when South cashes the @SA. "],["pg",""],["ls","sswses"],["pc","sascs"],["pg",""],["md","0,s4,,h8"],["hs","wses"],["nt","If both defenders have 2 spades left there is no way for South to avoid losing 2 trump tricks. "],["pg",""],["md","0,h8,,s4"],["md","0,s4,,sj"],["at","Similarly, if either defender has 3 or more spades left headed by the @SK and @SJ, 2 trump tricks will also have to be lost. "],["pg",""],["md","0,sk,,s4"],["hs","ss"],["at","If the @SK is now singleonton the best South can do is to continue with a small spade from his hand. "],["pg",""],["ls","sswses"],["pc","sscs"],["pg",""],["hs","wheh"],["at","This will not be good enough, however, as the defense will take the @HA "],["pg",""],["ls","wheh"],["pc","hhhah"],["pg",""],["hs","esss"],["at","and the remaining @SJ doubleton will represent a certain 4th trick for the defense. "],["pg",""],["up","8"],["md","0,sj,,sk"],["hs","ws"],["nt","South's only chance is if one of the defenders now has a singleton @SJ. South should continue with the @SQ in the hope that the @SJ will be pinned under it. The defense will win the @SK "],["pg",""],["ls","wsesss"],["pc","sqscsk"],["pg",""],["hs","ehnd"],["at","and the best they can do is to take the @HA in order to stop South from making an overtrick by later discarding both of his remaining hearts on dummy's diamonds. "],["pg",""],["ls","ehnd"],["pc","hahhh"],["pg",""],["hs","sses"],["at","South can later draw the rest of the trump and make his contract."],["",""]]}}